# The build context is this producer's own directory, and two things are COPYed
# out of it: its control template and its own maintainer script. The shared
# copyright file lives one level up and arrives through the `family` named
# context producer.env declares, so an edit to the driver, the README or a
# sibling producer cannot invalidate this producer's context.
#
# The payload itself is not here. It arrives through the `overlay` build
# context build-env/deb/build.sh resolves from producer.env.
*
!control/*.control
!maintainer/**
